    `Model: expected final turnout = ${intention.toFixed(0)}% - stated offset ${offset.toFixed(1)}pp = ${expectedFinal.toFixed(1)}% (sd ${sd.toFixed(1)}pp); P(final >= ${thr}%) computed from these live inputs`,
